### Method Documentation Standards

#### Clear User vs Schema Distinction
```rust
/// Get user instance at position 0 (maps to Bennett's "Will" term character)
/// Returns the user-provided data for the first position of the triad
fn get_user_instance_at(&self, position: usize) -> Option<&str> {
    self.user_instance_index.get(position)
}

/// Get Bennett's term character for position 0
/// Returns "Will" for triad's first position regardless of user data
fn get_term_character(&self, position: usize) -> Option<&str> {
    self.term_characters().get(position)
}
```

