### Implementation Patterns

#### Structure Creation
```rust
// ✅ CORRECT - Clear field usage
pub fn create_structure(
    name: String,
    structure_type: String,
    user_instance_index: Vec<String>, // User-provided data
) -> Result<StoredStructure, SystematicsError> {
    // Validate against term_characters from schema
    let schema = get_structure_schema(&structure_type)?;
    if user_instance_index.len() != schema.term_characters.len() {
        return Err(SystematicsError::InvalidUserInstanceCount);
    }
    // ... rest of implementation
}
```

#### Validation Logic
```rust
// ✅ CORRECT - Clear separation of concerns
fn validate_structure(structure: &StoredStructure) -> Result<(), SystematicsError> {
    // Validate user instances against schema
    let schema = get_schema(&structure.structure_type)?;
    
    if structure.user_instance_index.len() != schema.term_characters.len() {
        return Err(SystematicsError::UserInstanceCountMismatch {
            expected: schema.term_characters.len(),
            actual: structure.user_instance_index.len(),
        });
    }
    
    // Additional validation...
    Ok(())
}
```

